  "sourceTitle": "summer salsa",
  "sourceText": "summer salsa\nBy: uropean cutie\nPublished: Monday, August 12, 2013 - 2:01pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\nIngredients ♥\nmakes about 2 cups\n3 large tomatoes diced\n1/2 medium onion chopped\n1-2 jalapenos, chopped\nfresh cilantro, chopped, to taste\n1 lime juice\n1 tablespoon garlic infused olive oil\nsea salt to taste\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Instructions ♥ 2 Combine all ingredients in a large bowl until well blended. Taste and adjust seasonings as needed enjoy! ♥\n\nAbout\n\nHere is a great fresh healthy summer salsa, you can use it as a dip, or topping, try it with chicken, fish, or even pork! Refreshing and light! enjoy",
